n't let her go, I'll just have to take her by force!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh yeah? Perfect. Show me how much you've grown."}]}]}]}
